1. What Genie is
Genie is a wish-discovery companion for families supporting someone near
the end of life. It starts with what someone loves---music, food,
places, films and family memories---rather than generic activity
suggestions. The Qloo-backed engine helps build a Taste Portrait and
traceable personal wishes. Families can invite contributions through
Wish Circle, approach suitable Wish Makers, track requests, and compile
a printable or shareable Wish Book.

Product tagline: Everyone deserves to be known before they go.

Genie is not a medical service. The product explicitly distinguishes
family-provided information (told), reactions (reacted), inferred
suggestions (likely) and AI-only content (ai-only). Fictional demo
people and sample Wish Makers remain clearly labelled.
2. Architecture and capabilities
